/// Ten CPT codes with their published meanings and the usual departmental grouping. The charge in this source is drawn INDEPENDENTLY of the code - every code averages between $391.76 and $397.46 - so this dimension carries volume and mix faithfully and revenue not at all. No measure ranks a procedure by money.
